Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:04.44,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I have to run! I have to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:09.08,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:14.75,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:20.82,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,have anywhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.45,0:01:56.55,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:02:02.57,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 7: THE MAGIC DIARY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.07,0:01:59.23,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,You not supposed to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:02.81,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:06.28,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,You must now care diligently \Nfor this fellow,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:09.40,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,until he recovers from the injury \Nhe accepted in your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:15.55,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I forgot. \NI didn't mean to make you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:19.69,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,That will be your first responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.73,0:02:25.67,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,But what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:27.71,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Why did you run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.71,0:02:33.46,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I think you know the reason, Minos. \NThey said I'm a poisonous monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:34.50,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.87,0:02:38.11,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm going to be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:42.34,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna would never do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:52.42,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh, this little guy must have \Neaten a poisonous mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:54.32,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Might be new to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:03:01.57,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, don't do that! Claude just \Ntold you not to touch the black fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:09.24,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh. He looks a little better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.24,0:03:10.26,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:15.46,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Lize? Doesn't it hurt \Nwhen you absorb the black fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:19.57,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I guess it makes me feel a little heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:22.98,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:30.60,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,if I can handle that, at least \Nit cleans up the world a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:38.48,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,That's something I like about you, Lize, \Nbut it also makes me kinda sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.45,0:03:41.03,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Just like Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:51.14,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You weren't supposed to hear any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.99,0:03:53.83,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Wait. You didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:03.22,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hey, Luna. The kid's been \Nsniffing poison again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:06.97,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:09.37,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:38.30,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:42.54,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:22.80,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I've been swallowed up so many times \Nby that dark sludge in my dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.23,0:05:25.89,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,but you came and held on to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:32.33,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,You saved me. Nobody else even heard \Nme cry out before, but you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:41.11,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,You're the only one who noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:45.82,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Even if it's only in dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:51.75,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,you were the only one who understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:06.22,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:12.04,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,In your own clumsy way, \Nyou smiled upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:17.78,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I don't care what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.48,0:06:24.89,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Even if you're a horrifying witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:36.69,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Even if you're the person \Nwho will kill me one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:42.19,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Every time you use mushrooms to \Ndraw the poison out like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:49.26,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,you're also sucking out the memories \Nthat those mushrooms fed on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.73,0:06:51.14,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Probably along with any growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:54.20,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.47,0:06:57.94,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,A sorrow mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:06:58.61,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:01.98,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,A mushroom that grew out of \Nthe sorrow this child carries
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:05.79,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,from being placed in a situation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.79,0:07:08.40,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,where he always has to tiptoe \Naround others' emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:10.47,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,He's a vessel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:14.66,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,burdened to serve as the final \Ncontainer for other people's poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:17.89,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,No one else can understand \Nthe darkness he lives in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.41,0:07:20.84,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,That poison, with nowhere else to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:23.40,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,is what will turn him into \NThe End of All Things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:30.67,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I'll start being more \Nstrict with him tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.57,0:07:36.93,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,to make him a magician strong enough to \Novercome the fate of a cursed youngling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:44.81,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Please don't cry, Miss Witch. When I \Nwake up, I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:48.35,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,"Master, I realize I am \Nan unworthy apprentice,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:52.28,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,but I humbly ask for your guidance."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:10.16,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,What is this? I feel a kind \Nof heaviness in my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.16,0:08:15.90,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I feel like I endured something really \Npainful, but I can't remember what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:21.35,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But I think I remember Miss Witch's \Nwarm hand gently holding my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:24.56,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,What was that all about, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:26.99,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,As punishment for trying \Nto run away yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:30.03,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,you are not allowed to set foot \Noutside this house for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:31.78,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:32.63,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,WARM HAND
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:36.47,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Did I really try to run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:41.34,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Actually, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.11,0:08:44.33,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.15,0:08:47.35,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,When your mushroom draws out his poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.35,0:08:49.69,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,it removes more than just \Nthe cause of the blight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.11,0:08:53.59,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,It also eliminates all \Nmemories associated with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.83,0:08:57.07,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,probably including any growth \Nhe experienced during that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:01.21,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,That would be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:03.66,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Well, there's nothing I can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:08.58,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,But that will have a big effect \Non his ability to master magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.03,0:09:10.92,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You've gotta do something about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:15.31,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,If you don't, he's heading straight \Nfor an execution at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:26.75,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,The crow is bullying Miss Witch again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.16,0:09:30.62,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Why does she put up \Nwith that crow, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:33.51,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Good question. He's a real annoying crow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.75,0:09:38.26,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Is he a friend? An annoying neighbor?\N Some kind of ugly pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:41.03,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I'd better go rescue Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:43.47,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Oh, no. Is he a lover?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:45.30,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And emotionally abusive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:47.39,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Don't let him get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.39,0:09:48.99,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And emotionally abusive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:51.66,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Cut it out, you dumb crow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.70,Italics - Top,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And emotionally abusive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:54.54,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:58.32,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,What's up with him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:10:00.91,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Wow, he sure looks gloomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:05.15,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Give me a break. He starts pouting \Nas soon as he gets in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:07.04,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Is he really that thin-skinned?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:10.07,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,He seemed okay a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.07,0:10:11.67,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I'll go and ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:13.48,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,What's a-happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:18.07,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,If he keeps accumulating more of \Nthat blight without even realizing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.65,0:10:22.11,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,he'll never be able to hold on\N to even a single memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:28.31,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,First, he needs a way to deal with \Nthe poison he collects on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:33.57,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Otherwise all your magic \Ntraining will go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.32,0:10:44.58,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Miss Witch gave me magical \Npaper to use as a diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:48.83,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Starting today, if anything unpleasant \Nhappens to you, write it down on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:53.96,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Miss Witch made this special magical \Npaper from the mushrooms she grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.94,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,She's mixing something in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:59.29,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,And it's supposed to have \Nthe ability to extract poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.29,0:11:00.72,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,She's filtering it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:02.22,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,She's drying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:03.49,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,She's training it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:04.72,Flashback,Merino,0,0,0,,That must hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.15,0:11:07.00,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.47,0:11:12.26,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,It's impossible to write anything down \Non this paper with charcoal or a pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:17.55,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Apparently, you can only write things \Ndown by projecting feelings and memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:23.45,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Using magic to draw from feelings and \Nmemories is very difficult, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:23.45,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,{\an8}There!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:29.00,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,So I have a really hard time recording \Nonly my bad memories on the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:33.43,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,The bad memories I write down \Non this magic mushroom paper
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.77,0:11:36.00,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,become mushrooms themselves \Nand float away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:45.25,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I learned that these are \Ncalled yuck-shrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:49.10,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Once they float high enough, \Nthey flutter and disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.47,0:11:54.27,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,My own unpleasant memories completely \Ndisappear along with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:58.67,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,However, I also think there \Nis something melancholy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.67,0:12:01.03,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,about how beautifully these \Nyuck-shrooms disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:07.14,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Also, I have a feeling that I still \Nneed those yucky feelings somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.25,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,so this makes me a little uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:14.54,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I haven't been able to tell Miss Witch \Nhow I feel about it yet, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:19.55,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,But why do I have to go through all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:23.24,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,For some reason, I'm almost \Nafraid to know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.66,0:12:26.80,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I haven't been able to ask yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:41.82,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,This diary is enough to clear away \Nthe faint amounts of blight
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:47.70,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,that I encounter in my daily life, \Nbut it isn't well-suited
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:50.87,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,for very complicated feelings, \Nor deeply traumatic incidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:53.96,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,There seems to be another \Nmethod for dealing with those.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:13:00.46,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You call this a diary? All you write \Nabout is Luna, the cat, and the sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:02.12,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,And a little bit about the bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:07.72,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hey, it's your fault for \Nleaving it out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:10.49,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You're supposed to keep it \Ntucked away in your ear, moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.89,0:13:16.35,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,The only feelings and memories \Nthat stick in the diary
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:20.60,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,are the ones with no nastiness, \Nso it's full of stuff about Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:24.40,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,There's almost nothing about the crow,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:28.10,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,who starts acting like an annoying pest\N if I so much as acknowledge him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.10,0:13:29.75,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,but his existence is insignificant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.89,Default - Top,Claude,0,0,0,,What do you think you're looking at? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:31.89,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Because of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:34.14,Default - Top,Claude,0,0,0,,You were thinking some \Nrude crap about me, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:37.14,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,every time I see the crow, it feels \Nlike we're meeting for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:38.21,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,and that's exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:40.53,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Why is there only a little bit about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.53,0:13:41.19,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:45.17,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize! Get up! It's morning already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.48,0:13:47.18,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,I wanna play, Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:50.81,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,Are crows in black because \Nthey always act like jerks,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:53.91,Flashback,Minos,0,0,0,,or do they act like jerks because \Nthey're always in black? Which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.91,0:13:57.21,Flashback,Claude,0,0,0,,You know, I could go for a nice, \N{\i1}blackened{\i0} steak right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.19,0:14:00.44,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Is it because you hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:02.85,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with \Nhow I feel about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:05.72,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Honest? You know how sensitive I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.72,0:14:08.85,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I'm glad that it helps me \Nforget unpleasant things,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.85,0:14:10.57,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,but it can be inconvenient sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:16.11,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,When I asked the crow before \Nwhy I had to keep doing this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:18.08,Flashback,Claude,0,0,0,,I already told ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:22.09,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,He put his foot down and \Njust got unreasonably angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:27.71,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Maybe I'm starting to become numb \Nto all of the nastiness from the crow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.71,0:14:30.42,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,because sometimes notes about \Nhim don't disappear now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:32.51,Italics,Lize,0,0,0,,{\an8}Has my diary... been tainted?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.45,0:14:32.51,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I'm not quite sure what to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:33.35,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:38.28,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I guess it started feeling futile, because\N one day I honestly forgot to write in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:42.11,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,but Miss Witch immediately scolded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:52.07,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:55.24,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.39,Default - Top,Merino,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.39,0:14:58.00,Default,Sisi,0,0,0,,Upsy daisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:01.92,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,It's all bouncy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:04.45,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Hey, look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:07.76,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:11.76,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:13.23,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:15.26,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:18.11,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,You're so clumsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:45.48,Default,Sisi,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:50.09,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Listen, listen! Lize is super clumsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:52.85,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Your recreation idea \Nseems to be paying off,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:58.60,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,but I hope you realize this is only \Na temporary fix to reduce the murkiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.97,0:16:03.18,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, Miss Witch, is this mushroom from...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.18,0:16:06.14,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Whoa. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.93,0:16:11.74,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:14.24,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:26.25,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I-I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:28.50,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Man, oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.94,0:16:34.88,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:38.45,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:41.88,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, aren't you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:46.44,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat it all if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.93,0:16:50.40,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm just not very hungry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.97,0:16:54.90,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,May I go get some fresh air \Nby the window in that room?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:00.91,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.91,0:17:11.65,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,If I write about today in my diary, \Nthe bad feelings will go away,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.02,0:17:16.84,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,but I wonder if all the fun \Nmemories will disappear, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.14,0:17:21.54,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.69,0:17:25.43,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,You seem to be upset, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:29.57,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,It's not healthy to keep feelings \Nbottled up inside, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:33.42,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,The mushroom's talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:39.58,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,I am connected to the lord of\N this forest. I am a friend of Luna's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:41.58,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Lord of the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:46.92,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, boy. I'd be happy \Nto listen to you, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:52.07,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,You should get everything off your \Nchest and release all that darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:18:00.60,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Put your hand on my cap and talk to me. \NThat should help to ease the tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:05.84,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I have trouble understanding Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:11.36,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I thought she was really strict, \Nbut she also seems very kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:16.13,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,But sometimes I still get \Nthe feeling she really hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:20.31,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,My feelings and memories \Nare always so unreliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:25.12,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I want to keep a stronger handle on \Nmy emotions, but I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:26.52,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm so confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:31.10,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,It feels like the ground under \Nmy feet is about to crumble,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:35.23,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,or a big wave will come \Nalong and wash me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:40.89,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I need something... I need someone \Nto make a strong connection with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:42.61,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:51.27,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Also, I can't really explain it, but \NMiss Witch has some pretty weird tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:53.52,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:59.15,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,And actually, I'm not sure \Nif I should be saying this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:05.91,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,but I don't like her cooking at all, \Nand that stresses me out a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:12.55,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Everything looks really tasty, but \NI dunno, it all has this bizarre flavor
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:15.90,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,that doesn't match its appearance at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.30,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Oh, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:23.18,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'd cook myself if I knew how, but she \Nwon't let me set foot in the kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:27.56,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,and there's no way I can \Ntell anyone else about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:29.45,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:29.45,Default - Top,Claude,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:34.86,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Don't you know about Luna, my boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:41.66,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,I suppose not. What would you do if \NLuna's body and breath were poisonous...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:42.33,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.33,0:19:45.69,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,And that if you touched her, \Nyour skin would rot off,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.69,0:19:49.74,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,and that if you inhaled her breath, \Nyou would become ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:55.57,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,What would you do then? What would \Nyou think? Would you be disgusted?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.19,0:19:59.03,Default,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Would you not want to \Nstay with her anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:04.57,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.70,0:20:43.76,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, when I sleep alone, I'm always \Nafraid I'll have nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.15,0:20:46.97,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Are you sure I can't \Njust sleep here instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:03.53,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,All right, as long as \Nyou stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:07.53,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:10.47,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.47,0:21:15.04,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, I want you to hold my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:20.55,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I wrapped my hand in the \Nnew sock you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.95,0:21:23.38,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.50,0:21:30.52,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I need something... I need someone \Nto make a strong connection with
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.17,0:21:35.59,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,because I have no one in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.50,0:21:58.33,Flashback_Italics,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.71,0:21:59.96,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.81,0:22:04.84,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,Roses all have thorns, and lilies \Nof the valley are poisonous,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:08.34,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,but I still like roses and lilies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.65,0:22:13.87,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, but the surface isn't \Nimportant. What I really want
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.87,0:22:15.71,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,is to be able to touch somebody's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:19.77,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,Do you understand what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.77,0:22:21.80,Flashback,Chatty Mushroom,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.12,0:22:25.78,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,That night, I ended up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.83,0:22:30.27,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,having a truly wonderful dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.12,0:22:38.25,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,TRANSLATION: MICHAEL ARNOLD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.37,0:22:41.46,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SUBTITLE TIMING: ANDY ELLIS\NEDITING: ELISABETH CRIST
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:46.21,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,QUALITY CHECK: GABRIELLA ALABANZA\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.65,0:24:40.25,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,NEXT TIME:\NTHE WHITE WITCH AND THE BLACK WITCH
